---
import Eyebrow from "../components/Eyebrow.astro";
import TechStack from "../components/TechStack.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Software Engineer focused on building meaningful products with clean architecture and an eye for detail."
>
  <section id="about">
    <Eyebrow label="About" />
    <h1>Crafting modern digital experiences</h1>
    <p>
      I'm a Software Engineer focused on building meaningful products with clean
      architecture and a strong attention to detail.
    </p>

    <p>
      Throughout my career, I’ve worked with several software agencies in
      Croatia, collaborating with clients across different industries, primarily
      in Europe. This has allowed me to gain experience working on diverse
      products and solving a wide range of technical challenges.
    </p>

    <p>
      My work spans web applications, microservices, and mobile apps. I enjoy
      designing scalable systems, writing maintainable code, and building
      products that provide real value to users.
    </p>

    <p>
      The projects I’ve worked on range from public administration and tax
      systems to banking platforms, companion mobile apps, and various web-based
      services.
    </p>
    <TechStack />
  </section>
</Layout>
